  "subject": "a young tenant in an old Kaohsiung walk-up who scrapes the white efflorescence (wall cancer) off his rented room's damp wall every spring, layers on waterproof paint and filler, and watches it bloom back beside the patch, refusing to give up on one clean white wall",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien grunge revival, 2025 grunge revival in the 90s Seattle tradition. Clean arpeggiated guitar in the verses; drop-D fuzz guitars crashing in on the chorus; thick distorted bass; heavy pounding live drums with open hi-hat. Loud-quiet-loud dynamics, thick warm tone with modern clarity. Raw male baritone, clearly sung melody, gritty full-throated chorus. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 96 BPM, E minor. Stubborn, gritty, wry. No screaming, no metalcore breakdown, no autotune, no pop-punk brightness, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n租的房間 壁角白白\n一沿一沿 親像生菇\n我提鏟仔 一下一下刮\n白粉 落甲規頭鬃\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n房東講 舊厝攏按呢\n你莫想傷濟\n\n[Chorus]\n刮刮刮 壁癌閣來\n今年刮 明年閣開\n我抹防水 抹三層\n伊猶原 對我笑\n\n[Verse]\n暗時睏 鼻著塗味\n壁內底 有水咧行\n我耳空 貼佇壁頂\n聽伊 咧喘氣\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n五金行的頭家講\n少年仔 你拚袂贏\n\n[Chorus]\n刮刮刮 壁癌閣來\n今年刮 明年閣開\n我買批土 補一窟\n伊佇邊仔 閣開花\n\n[Verse]\n我毋是欲贏\n干焦欲一面 白白的壁\n掛一張圖 貼一張相\n親像 家己的厝\n\n[Bridge]\n鏟仔落 壁咧哭\n我喙齒根 咬咧\n\n[Chorus]\n刮刮刮 壁癌閣來\n我年年 共伊刮\n這面壁 毋是我的\n毋過 是我咧顧\n\n[Outro]\n刮刮刮 閣一擺\n白粉 落佇我肩胛",
